# Big media is NOT copied into each Vercel deployment (saves ~105 MB per deploy).
# The files stay in GitHub and are served through jsDelivr by the rewrites in vercel.json,
# so every URL (/<page>/m/..., /media/..., /social/media/...) keeps working.
/*/m/
/media/
/social/media/
.github/
README.md
tools/
